termediate"><addressbook><name>MIYASHITA, MITSUHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHINO, MASAKAZU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA YUJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYASHITA MITSUHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHINO MASAKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA, YUJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYASHITA, MITSUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHINO, MASAKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>In recording/reproducing a digital video signal having 1080 effective lines, an MPEG stream is taken out on the reproducer side without using a large space of a storage medium, with simple constitution, and without significant image quality degradation.  A macro block construction circuit (pseudo MPEG) (20) constitutes a 16-line macro block and an 8-line macro block from the digital video signal at a compression circuit.  A DCT circuit (MPEG) (22) applies a field DCT or a frame DCT prescribed by the MPEG standards to the 16-line macro block, and the frame DCT only to the 8-line macro block.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Lors de l'enregistrement/la lecture d'un signal vidéo numérique ayant 1080 lignes effectives, un train de données MPEG est prélevé du côté lecteur sans l'utilisation d'un large espace du support d'enregistrement, au moyen d'une construction simple, et sans dégradation notable de la qualité de l'image. Un circuit de construction de macrobloc (pseudo-MPEG) (20) forme un macrobloc de 16 lignes et un macrobloc de 8 lignes à partir du signal vidéo numérique au niveau d'un circuit de compression. Un circuit DCT (MPEG) (22) applique une transformation en cosinus discrète (DCT) de champ ou une transformation en cosinus discrète (DCT) de trame prescrite par les standards MPEG au macrobloc de 16 lignes et une transformation en cosinus discrète (DCT) de trame uniquement au macrobloc de 8 lignes.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>